-+| S2.2 item 3 | Explicit child environment allowlist | `deploy/standalone/entrypoint.py:build_child_env` | PASS: Only `PATH`, `KB_WEB_DIST`, `KB_DEPLOYMENT_MODE`, `DATABASE_URL`, `LANG` passed |
