-+### [DEP-EVAL KANBA-40] OpenAIProvider Adapter (openai)
-+
-+- Evaluator: Application and Supply-Chain Security Engineer (sec-eng)
-+- Scope: docs/tickets/KB-P5-03.md (KANBA-40 / KB-P5-03)
